Open pull requests of rexglue/rexglue-sdk, taken as they are (2026-11-01), for the macOS build:

  #531 fix(core): POSIX events lose wakeups in SignalAndWait and set/reset pulses
       (hangs found on macOS: SignalAndWait wasn't atomic, an auto-reset Signal woke every waiter, and a
       manual-reset set-then-reset didn't release the threads waiting at that moment)
  #538 fix(chrono): clamp NT-to-steady_clock delta so early due times can't overflow
       (a guest timer re-armed with a due time near 1601 after a long frame never fired: found on an M4)
  #497 fix(xam): don't sleep in XMPGetPlaybackController (a 10 ms sleep per call)
  #479 fix(filesystem): list symlinked directories as directories on POSIX
       (a game folder made of symlinks, as the launcher's "Use a Folder" may be given)
  #496 fix(xam): enumerator release, item count on NO_MORE_FILES, task thread handle
       (the content enumeration the game's save path uses)

